      "ruku": 327,
      "hizbQuarter": 151,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3163,
      "text": "As for those who do not believe in the Hereafter, We have made their deeds appealing to them, so they wander blindly.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 377,
      "ruku": 327,
      "hizbQuarter": 151,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3164,
      "text": "Such are those who will have a terrible punishment, and it is they who will be the greatest losers in the Hereafter.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 377,
      "ruku": 327,
      "hizbQuarter": 151,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3165,
      "text": "Indeed, you are receiving the Qur’an from the All-Wise, All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 377,
      "ruku": 327,
      "hizbQuarter": 151,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3166,
      "text": "[Remember] when Moses said to his family, “I have spotted a fire. I will bring you some news[2] from there, or bring you a burning brand so that you may warm yourselves.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 377,
      "ruku": 327,
      "hizbQuarter": 151,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3167,
      "text": "When he came to it, he was called, “Blessed is He Who is at the fire and those who are around it[3]. Glory be to Allah, the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 377,
      "ruku": 327,
      "hizbQuarter": 151,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3168,
      "text": "O Moses, verily this is Me – Allah, the All-Mighty, the All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 377,
      "ruku": 327,
      "hizbQuarter": 151,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3169,
      "text": "Throw down your staff!” But when he saw it slithering as if it were a snake, he turned and ran away without looking back. “O Moses, do not be afraid! Indeed, the messengers should have no fear in My presence,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 19,
